<title>HONG KONG: Realty Dev year net rises 32.8 percent.</title>
<headline>Realty Dev year net rises 32.8 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Earnings per A Shr (H.K. cents) 773.0   vs  580.0</p>
<p>    Earnings per B Shr (H.K. cents) 155.0   vs  116.0</p>
<p>    Dividend A shr (H.K. cents)     150.0   vs  134.0</p>
<p>    Dividend B shr (H.K. cents)     30.0    vs  26.8</p>
<p>    Exceptional items		   nil     vs  284.6 gain</p>
<p>    Net				     1,780.4 vs  1,340.2</p>
<p>    Turnover				3,794.0 vs  3,115.6</p>
<p>    Company name			  Realty Development Corp Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close			   September 12-18</p>
<p>    Dividend payable		    September 25</p>
<p>NOTE - Realty Development is a property firm that also operates business clubs.</p>
<p>Total dividend per A share is 181.5 H.K. cents (including an interim dividend of 31.5 cents) vs 165.5 cents, and 36.3 cents per B share (including an interim dividend of 6.3 cents) vs 33.1 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
</text>
